Package: riya
Version: 1.0.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Tukaram <developer@riya.ai>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-tk, python3-pil, python3-numpy, python3-psutil, libportaudio2, libsndfile1, libgomp1, espeak-ng | piper, libnotify-bin
Recommends: wl-clipboard | xclip
Homepage: https://riya.ai
Description: Universal offline-first personal AI assistant
 RIYA is an offline-first personal AI assistant providing private local neural
 intelligence, speech recognition, speech synthesis, and desktop OS integration.
 Powered by local Qwen3 GGUF inference, faster-whisper STT, Silero VAD, and
 multi-backend Linux TTS without cloud dependencies or external telemetry.

